# Keep line endings as committed on every OS. Windows checkouts would otherwise turn LF into CRLF,
# which breaks the shell launcher (Windows batch files are the exception: they want CRLF) and changes the byte-exact fixed-width test fixtures.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
tests/fixtures/** -text
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
